  "term": "morbid",
  "definition": "Morbid means abnormal or diseased in a psychological sense, as in older usage where morbid psychology referred to what would be called abnormal psychology. It can also mean an over-sensitive, gloomy state marked by self-focused brooding and giving too much importance to shifts in feeling.",
